Se aplica búsqueda binaria en un array ordenado de tamaño 8:
```java
int[] A = {2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, 16};
int low = 0;
int high = 7;
int x = 12;
int pos = -1;
while (low <= high && pos == -1) {
    int mid = (low + high) / 2;
    if (A[mid] == x) {
        pos = mid;
    } else if (A[mid] < x) {
        low = mid + 1;
    } else {
        high = mid - 1;
    }
}
```

