Se analiza el algoritmo de ordenación por selección (Selection Sort):
```java
int[] A = {64, 25, 12, 22, 11};
int i = 0;
while (i < 4) {
    int min_idx = i;
    int j = i + 1;
    while (j < 5) {
        if (A[j] < A[min_idx]) {
            min_idx = j;
        }
        j++;
    }
    int temp = A[min_idx];
    A[min_idx] = A[i];
    A[i] = temp;
    i++;
}
```

